WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.370
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:02.370 --> 00:00:07.280
Magic Knight Rayearth
I, Hikaru Shidou, with Umi and
Fuu, was summoned once again...

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:07.970
I, Hikaru Shidou, with Umi and
Fuu, was summoned once again...

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:10.070
...to Cephiro, another world.

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:14.550
This world lost the Pillar who
supported it, Princess Emeraude...

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:17.650
...and was facing total destruction.

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:21.980
Chizeta, one of the invaders,
has backed down from Cephiro...

00:00:22.090 --> 00:00:26.320
...and with Fahren's princess,
Aska, also giving up on being Pillar...

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:29.520
...we were all pleased
from the bottom of our hearts.

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:35.040
However, Nova appeared inside
the castle again, taking Lantis away.

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:40.540
What'll you do if you're the one
who can be the Pillar, Hikaru?

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:46.240
And Clef revealed
exactly what Nova is.

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:52.210
Nova is someone who
was created by my own heart.

00:00:53.590 --> 00:00:54.750
Hikaru...

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:08.060
I feel it trembling
in the bottom of my heart...

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:12.870
...both the light and
the darkness that I warmly embrace.

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:18.270
A chase for the dream
that I just can't give up on...

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:24.450
And my love, full of pride,
comes to life right in front of me.

00:01:28.790 --> 00:01:32.490
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:01:32.490 --> 00:01:34.930
The warm, red
shades of the sunset...

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.490
...have a melancholy beauty.

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:45.670
Solitary tears fall into
the sea that I sealed away...

00:01:45.670 --> 00:01:49.440
...inside my heart.

00:01:50.150 --> 00:01:53.670
The bright light that I missed
will not come back to me.

00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:59.950
So I want freedom, just like the wind
that will come with the next sunrise.

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:07.620
I feel it trembling in
the bottom of my heart...

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:12.300
...both the light and
the darkness that I warmly embrace.

00:02:12.970 --> 00:02:17.800
A chase for the dream
that I just can't give up on...

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:21.980
Someday I want to find for myself...

00:02:22.210 --> 00:02:28.170
...a future that has no end.

00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:37.150
Hikaru in Shock!
The Truth About Nova

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:42.350
Flame Arrow!

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:53.830
Lantis...

00:03:54.340 --> 00:03:55.430
Hikaru!

00:03:56.810 --> 00:03:57.740
Clef!

00:03:57.840 --> 00:03:59.240
Lantis is...

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:03.980
I am tracking his consciousness
as well, but I don't know his location!

00:04:04.080 --> 00:04:06.240
Lantis was injured!

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:09.010
Blood... There was lots of blood!

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:10.950
Nova... Nova was...

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:12.820
Calm down, Hikaru.

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:16.360
If you don't keep calm,
Nova will become even stronger.

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:22.560
I'm sure I heard
something like an explosion!

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:24.990
I wonder what happened.

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:26.970
Are you all right, Lady Aska?

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:29.430
You heard it too?

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:30.370
Yes.

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:33.570
Hikaru's scream...
I heard it in my heart.

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:36.610
It seemed as though
Ms. Hikaru was crying.

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:47.920
Everyone, stand back!

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:53.020
Water Dragon!

00:04:59.430 --> 00:05:01.830
The wounds are regenerating!

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:13.640
Emerald Typhoon!

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:25.090
Above you!

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:34.700
Ferio!

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:48.080
Ms. Aska!

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:15.200
Sapphire Whirlwind!

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:21.570
We can't lose at this point!

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:24.480
We finally understand each other.

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:45.230
Tarta! Tatra!

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:50.170
Look out!

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:55.370
Ferio!

00:06:57.820 --> 00:07:01.080
It's because we want
to protect the people we love...

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:03.950
...that we are all fighting.

00:07:04.260 --> 00:07:05.990
We absolutely...

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:07.760
...can't lose!

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:19.740
Emerald Cyclone!

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:31.280
Ice Blade!

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:42.500
We did it!

00:07:45.830 --> 00:07:46.770
We did it!

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:48.240
We did it!
Thank goodness, right, Lady Aska?

00:07:48.240 --> 00:07:49.290
Thank goodness, right, Lady Aska?

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:51.960
Fuu is very powerful after all!

00:07:52.440 --> 00:07:55.240
Ms. Umi, you have a new spell...

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:57.110
You too, Fuu.

00:07:57.980 --> 00:07:59.340
Impossible!

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:01.310
That can't be!

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:04.520
Ms. Hikaru!

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:06.310
What's wrong, Hikaru?

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:08.980
Impossible...

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:11.650
That can't be...

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:20.030
That girl who calls herself
Nova is a shadow of your heart.

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:35.770
Back then, I kept
screaming in my heart...

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:39.050
That this can't be true.

00:08:39.150 --> 00:08:41.180
That it couldn't be true.

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:51.660
But I couldn't say it.

00:08:51.770 --> 00:08:55.960
If I said it, I felt like
my heart would just shatter.

00:08:56.670 --> 00:09:00.200
I'm sure Umi and Fuu
felt the same way too.

00:09:02.210 --> 00:09:05.940
Princess Emeraude was finally free...

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:14.680
That's why I couldn't say it.

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:19.420
That scream within your
heart became a strong light...

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:23.200
...and burned
a shadow here in Cephiro.

00:09:23.530 --> 00:09:25.120
That's Nova?

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:26.520
Yes.

00:09:26.630 --> 00:09:30.400
Nova is your shadow,
a piece of your heart.

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:38.280
Regret, sorrow,
and aggravation at yourself...

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:44.040
Every aspect of that was burned
onto Cephiro in that one instant.

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:51.580
Back then, because I had
to fight Princess Emeraude...

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:54.090
...I didn't know what to do.

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:56.890
Because you hate yourself...

00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:59.630
...I love you, Hikaru.

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:06.230
That's why Nova
said that she loved me.

00:10:06.510 --> 00:10:07.630
Because I...

00:10:07.740 --> 00:10:10.940
I couldn't forgive myself then.

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:12.580
Hikaru...

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:16.880
Nova is my heart...

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:20.080
Then the one who injured Lantis...

00:10:20.860 --> 00:10:22.150
...is me?

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:43.340
What is wrong, Nova?

00:10:45.880 --> 00:10:48.080
My heart hurts.

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:54.810
It's probably that Magic
Knight's heart flooding into you.

00:10:58.460 --> 00:11:01.390
This man that you
have captured, Nova...

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:04.690
He has a heart
that is fearfully strong.

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:10.670
I will have this strength
put to my advantage.

00:11:17.810 --> 00:11:20.370
You're crying, Hikaru...

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:23.880
You're thinking
about Lantis and crying.

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:25.580
It's strange...

00:11:26.020 --> 00:11:27.990
My heart hurts.

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:30.120
Why?

00:11:38.570 --> 00:11:43.700
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:49.700
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:58.450 --> 00:11:59.720
Hikaru...

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:04.020
You're hurt...

00:12:06.090 --> 00:12:07.250
Hikaru...

00:12:09.100 --> 00:12:10.430
I'm sorry...

00:12:11.400 --> 00:12:12.490
Lantis...

00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:16.230
Because of me, he got hurt...

00:12:16.940 --> 00:12:19.670
And because of me,
he was abducted...

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:22.170
Abducted?

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:24.400
By who?

00:12:25.580 --> 00:12:26.840
Me.

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:34.610
Master Mage Clef, you're being
reckless in your current condition!

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:36.350
I don't care!

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:37.820
Master Mage...

00:12:37.930 --> 00:12:40.190
Even with my powers...

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:43.490
...I can only tell that Debonair...

00:12:46.730 --> 00:12:50.500
...is somewhere near Cephiro.

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:52.530
The only one...

00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:54.940
...who knows is Alcyone.

00:12:55.480 --> 00:12:59.470
Hurry... We must hurry
and ask her, or once again...

00:12:59.580 --> 00:13:04.920
Once again, I will deeply sadden
the girls from another world...

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:14.590
That girl is from your heart...

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:19.030
I heard you were
Lantis's friend, Eagle.

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:22.560
That's why I have to apologize.

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:26.170
Why did you come to me?

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:31.850
I'm the commander of the Autozam
fleet that's here to invade Cephiro.

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:35.350
Why did you come here alone?

00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:39.480
I wanted to apologize to
a person who loves Lantis.

00:13:42.260 --> 00:13:46.320
I thought that you
really loved Lantis, Eagle...

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:47.820
So...

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:52.960
If I embrace you now...

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:57.060
...will I be scolded by
the people who love you?

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:10.970
I'm sorry!

00:14:11.090 --> 00:14:13.210
I know I'm your enemy.

00:14:13.320 --> 00:14:17.350
But I just can't
come to hate you, Eagle.

00:14:17.560 --> 00:14:20.650
How you were kind
to me on the battleship...

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:24.100
How you saved Lantis
during the battle with Nova...

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:26.290
I can't forget about that.

00:14:28.370 --> 00:14:29.670
Me too.

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:37.300
Master Mage Clef...

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:39.040
Presea...

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:59.490
Lantis!

00:15:02.770 --> 00:15:04.600
You're protecting me?

00:15:07.140 --> 00:15:09.540
It's because I'm too cute.

00:15:12.780 --> 00:15:17.680
I wonder if Ms. Hikaru and the others
are all right. I wonder if they're hurt.

00:15:17.790 --> 00:15:19.220
They're all right!

00:15:19.320 --> 00:15:21.250
They're all so strong!

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:27.250
I wish we could be
strong just like them...

00:15:37.970 --> 00:15:38.960
Caldina!

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:44.010
What? What happened?

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:50.820
Did the crumbling of
Cephiro finally accelerate?

00:15:53.650 --> 00:15:54.750
Umi!

00:15:55.320 --> 00:15:56.220
Ascot!

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:02.120
W-Well, it's hard for me
to say this, but Umi...

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:05.600
It's all right.

00:16:07.870 --> 00:16:09.460
I love Umi.

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:12.470
That's what my heart honestly says.

00:16:12.970 --> 00:16:16.970
Even if Umi doesn't
think anything of me...

00:16:18.550 --> 00:16:22.950
...I'm all right because I can be
happy just being in love with her.

00:16:24.820 --> 00:16:25.910
Ascot...

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:29.250
I'm going where
Umi and the others are.

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:32.590
All right! Buck up and go find 'em!

00:16:34.830 --> 00:16:37.860
Ascot has matured.

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:40.970
I'm kinda happy but also sad...

00:16:41.300 --> 00:16:43.530
It's a complicated feelin'.

00:16:45.740 --> 00:16:46.930
Don't cry.

00:16:48.740 --> 00:16:52.080
If you cry, Lantis will be sad.

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:56.320
Lantis probably hates me.

00:16:57.450 --> 00:17:00.110
What I did to his brother...

00:17:00.220 --> 00:17:02.880
I know that he can't love me!

00:17:02.990 --> 00:17:04.580
But I love him.

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:06.630
I don't know why...

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:08.920
But...

00:17:12.770 --> 00:17:16.700
If you did know why,
then it wouldn't be true love.

00:17:18.310 --> 00:17:21.970
You don't know why,
but you love him, right?

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:28.440
I'm sure Princess
Emeraude, the last Pillar...

00:17:28.550 --> 00:17:31.810
...was thinking
the same thing that you are.

00:17:31.920 --> 00:17:36.080
Why she, the Pillar,
had fallen in love with a man...

00:17:36.790 --> 00:17:39.890
Why she couldn't stop her heart...

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:45.100
I'm sure she wasn't able
to come up with an answer herself.

00:17:46.470 --> 00:17:50.030
But still, she fell in love with Zagato...

00:17:51.510 --> 00:17:56.170
People all have feelings
that they cannot control.

00:17:56.940 --> 00:18:01.710
They always worry about those
hearts they can't do anything about.

00:18:02.280 --> 00:18:07.620
Even I've felt that I'd like to be
friends with you, my enemy, if I could.

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:10.710
Then about Lantis...

00:18:10.830 --> 00:18:11.920
Yes.

00:18:12.530 --> 00:18:15.220
It's true that I love Autozam.

00:18:15.330 --> 00:18:18.560
I don't want to allow
that country to go extinct, but...

00:18:19.230 --> 00:18:23.830
But I just couldn't
get rid of my true wish.

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:26.940
Your true wish?

00:18:30.950 --> 00:18:31.910
Eagle!

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:34.180
What's wrong, Eagle?

00:18:37.220 --> 00:18:38.980
E-Eagle...

00:18:41.190 --> 00:18:42.820
Don't worry...

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:45.590
But I'm sure that's impossible...

00:18:46.230 --> 00:18:47.420
Eagle...

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:55.130
Tell me, Alcyone...

00:18:55.740 --> 00:18:59.070
Where is Debonair,
the one who controlled you?

00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:06.380
Lantis, Zagato's younger brother, was
abducted by one of Debonair's people.

00:19:07.150 --> 00:19:09.410
We must hurry and rescue him...

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:12.450
Lord Zagato's younger brother...

00:19:13.320 --> 00:19:17.150
At this rate,
Cephiro truly will be destroyed.

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:20.520
Tell me, Alcyone!

00:19:21.830 --> 00:19:26.460
I don't care what happens to
a Cephiro without Lord Zagato.

00:19:29.300 --> 00:19:34.300
The man I risked everything for,
including betraying you, my master...

00:19:34.410 --> 00:19:36.340
...is no longer here.

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:42.110
Why did I remain alive?

00:19:44.050 --> 00:19:46.350
Even if my love wasn't returned...

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:49.790
...I wanted to die
with him at the very least.

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:53.290
Alcyone...

00:20:00.530 --> 00:20:02.800
Eagle, are you sick?

00:20:03.540 --> 00:20:05.200
Does Lantis know?

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:11.170
I absolutely don't want Lantis
to ever know about this.

00:20:15.080 --> 00:20:17.310
I have no time left.

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:21.110
You or me...

00:20:22.890 --> 00:20:26.190
It seems one of us
can become the Pillar.

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:31.730
We should make it clear...

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:36.830
I can't let Autozam
wither away as it is now.

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:42.640
But I'm sure you don't want Cephiro
to crumble away like this either.

00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:50.340
If I am qualified
to become the Pillar...

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:53.110
...I will stay in Cephiro.

00:20:53.220 --> 00:20:57.160
As the Pillar, so that I can
prevent this world from crumbling.

00:20:58.030 --> 00:21:01.690
In exchange, so that we can
analyze the Pillar system...

00:21:01.800 --> 00:21:06.200
...please allow the people
of Autozam to enter this country.

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:11.400
However, I promise that they
will make no attempt to invade.

00:21:17.780 --> 00:21:21.840
And if you are the Pillar...

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:29.450
...what are you going
to do with this country?

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:20.570
Shine someday.
Believing is just that.

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:30.080
Because it gives me
the courage to live on now.

00:22:32.190 --> 00:22:38.250
Blown by the winds of the ages.

00:22:39.630 --> 00:22:44.720
Groping around for tomorrow.

00:22:47.200 --> 00:22:52.830
Darkness spreads,
and only worries...

00:22:54.480 --> 00:22:59.540
...keep welling up.

00:23:01.820 --> 00:23:07.580
I will definitely find bright feelings...

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:14.290
...when I get over the sea of tears.

00:23:16.460 --> 00:23:23.600
Someday I will find it,
and the unyielding future...

00:23:24.270 --> 00:23:32.910
...will lead dreams
to a world full of light.

00:23:46.260 --> 00:23:47.690
I'm Nova.

00:23:47.830 --> 00:23:52.390
Mother Debonair said that
I could play again with Hikaru.

00:23:53.200 --> 00:23:57.300
I'm going to kill
everyone that Hikaru loves.

00:23:57.740 --> 00:23:58.940
For Hikaru's sake.

00:23:58.940 --> 00:24:01.310
For Hikaru's sake.
No! That's not it, Nova!

00:24:01.410 --> 00:24:04.100
Next time on Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:04.410 --> 00:24:08.070
The True Pillar Is: Hikaru or Eagle!?

00:24:08.450 --> 00:24:09.480
Nova, I'm...

00:24:09.480 --> 00:24:10.820
The True Pillar Is: Hikaru or Eagle!?
Nova, I'm...

00:24:10.820 --> 00:24:13.490
The True Pillar Is: Hikaru or Eagle!?

00:24:13.490 --> 00:24:20.420
Who is it today?

00:24:21.460 --> 00:24:23.400
Today, it's Hikaru!

00:24:23.500 --> 00:24:24.030
Look forward to the next episode!

00:24:24.030 --> 00:24:26.870
Look forward to the next episode!
Hey, everyone! Did you guess right?

00:24:26.870 --> 00:24:28.540
Look forward to the next episode!
See you later!

00:24:28.540 --> 00:24:29.470
Look forward to the next episode!
